WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:02.740
12 March 1994.

2
00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:04.310
Bristol Cathedral.

3
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.980
32 women are ordained as Anglican priests.

4
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:12.850
In 2026, Sarah Mullally is installed
as Archbishop of Canterbury,

5
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.200
the first woman in that office.

6
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:19.760
Yet the Catholic and Orthodox Churches
still ordain only men as priests,

7
00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:21.290
as they always have.

8
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.500
So why do churches differ?

9
00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:26.600
In this mission, you'll
learn what ordination means,

10
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:29.310
from deacon to priest to bishop.

11
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:33.170
Then you'll set the arguments
against and for side by side,

12
00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.020
and ask what they mean for people's lives.

13
00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:41.870
Your mission: find out why churches differ
so sharply on ordaining women as priests.
